WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.596 --> 00:00:16.876
was relieved that he wasn't punished.

2
00:00:16.896 --> 00:00:24.538
"I'm glad everything worked out," said Rishi's father, as they passed out of the arch and onto the

3
00:00:24.578 --> 00:00:25.238
street again.

4
00:00:25.258 --> 00:00:27.779
"What will you children do now?"

5
00:00:29.139 --> 00:00:30.740
Mandy remembered the photo.

6
00:00:32.216 --> 00:00:34.558
"Is there a river or lake nearby?"

7
00:00:35.238 --> 00:00:35.799
she asked.

8
00:00:37.060 --> 00:00:41.183
"You must mean the Ganges, the holy river," said Rishi.

9
00:00:41.203 --> 00:00:43.684
"I will take you there."

10
00:00:45.666 --> 00:00:50.289
They said good-bye to Rishi's father, and the children walked down the road.

11
00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:53.211
Soon, they heard music.

12
00:00:54.592 --> 00:00:59.476
By the road, an elderly man sat on a straw mat playing a flute.

13
00:01:00.924 --> 00:01:03.426
In front of him was a round basket.

14
00:01:04.928 --> 00:01:06.309
"What is that man doing?"

15
00:01:06.909 --> 00:01:07.610
asked Vinnie.

16
00:01:08.931 --> 00:01:10.813
Suddenly, a snake appeared.

17
00:01:12.174 --> 00:01:13.815
It swayed to the music.

18
00:01:13.835 --> 00:01:18.079
"He's a snake charmer," explained Rishi.

19
00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:23.083
The children watched the snake weave back and forth, hissing.

20
00:01:23.103 --> 00:01:28.368
"Come, here is the River Ganges," said Rishi.

21
00:01:29.596 --> 00:01:33.477
The children joined some people waiting for a boat on the riverbank.

22
00:01:34.938 --> 00:01:39.099
Once they were aboard, Mandy noticed pictures hanging everywhere.

23
00:01:39.119 --> 00:01:43.400
"Wow!" Mandy exclaimed.

24
00:01:43.420 --> 00:01:48.261
"This is a floating art gallery," explained Rishi.

25
00:01:48.281 --> 00:01:53.903
"People ride down the Ganges while they enjoy the drawings and paintings.

26
00:01:53.923 --> 00:02:01.266
"This one looks like a man with an elephant head," Vinnie said, pointing to a picture.

27
00:02:01.286 --> 00:02:04.689
"That's Ganesha," said Rishi.

28
00:02:04.709 --> 00:02:09.093
"He is our god of wisdom, science, and the arts."

29
00:02:10.534 --> 00:02:13.997
Vinnie and Mandy calmly watched the peaceful river.

30
00:02:15.238 --> 00:02:18.381
Along the shore, cattle were drinking lazily.

31
00:02:19.682 --> 00:02:24.566
Women filled jugs and then walked away, balancing them on their heads.

32
00:02:24.586 --> 00:02:30.073
"Mandy, the picture is glowing blue," whispered Vinnie.

33
00:02:30.094 --> 00:02:33.775
"Can you tell us about this river, Rishi?"

34
00:02:34.495 --> 00:02:35.196
asked Mandy.

35
00:02:35.216 --> 00:02:38.897
"This river is named for the goddess Ganga.

36
00:02:40.238 --> 00:02:44.420
She came to Earth and blessed these waters," began Rishi.

37
00:02:44.440 --> 00:02:49.902
"We believe that if we bathe in the river, our sins will be forgiven."

38
00:02:51.503 --> 00:02:53.204
The sun was about to set.

39
00:02:54.588 --> 00:02:57.070
A sudden splash caught their attention.

40
00:02:57.090 --> 00:03:00.213
"Rishi! What's that?"

41
00:03:01.034 --> 00:03:02.535
asked Mandy, pointing.

42
00:03:02.555 --> 00:03:09.981
"Oh, those are the sacred dolphins of the Ganges," cried Rishi.

43
00:03:10.001 --> 00:03:12.303
"Why are they sacred?"

44
00:03:12.884 --> 00:03:13.524
asked Vinnie.

45
00:03:13.544 --> 00:03:19.229
"The dolphins are special friends of the goddess Ganga," said Rishi.

46
00:03:19.249 --> 00:03:22.312
"We don't see them very often now.

47
00:03:23.584 --> 00:03:25.045
This is a special moment."

48
00:03:27.107 --> 00:03:30.810
Vinnie and Mandy watched as a dolphin swam closer.

49
00:03:32.251 --> 00:03:34.433
The photo was still glowing blue.

50
00:03:34.453 --> 00:03:38.456
"Thank you, Rishi," Vinnie said.

51
00:03:38.476 --> 00:03:41.719
"It's been a wonderful journey."

52
00:03:41.739 --> 00:03:43.980
"Are you going home?"

53
00:03:44.561 --> 00:03:45.321
asked Rishi.

54
00:03:46.703 --> 00:03:50.866
The dolphin jumped out of the water, and the photo glowed red.

55
00:03:50.886 --> 00:03:54.841
"Yes, we are," replied Vinnie.

56
00:03:56.521 --> 00:04:01.944
The children fell down the dark tunnel and landed with a thump on the attic floor.

57
00:04:01.964 --> 00:04:04.625
"Where are you kids?

58
00:04:05.986 --> 00:04:08.147
I thought I told you to fold the laundry!"

59
00:04:09.727 --> 00:04:11.628
Mom shouted from downstairs.

60
00:04:12.909 --> 00:04:17.911
Grinning, Vinnie and Mandy went downstairs to finish their job.
